    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="11">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 11</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gyf hwa cynges mundbrice elles gewyrce, gebete þæt mid V pundum on Engla lage, arcebiscopes and æþelinges mundbrice mid þrim pundum; oðres biscpæs and ealdormannes mid II pundum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone otherwise violates the king’s protection, he is to compensate for that with five pounds according to English law; violation of an archbishop’s and nobleman’s protection with three pounds; another bishop’s and ealdorman’s with two pounds.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 gyf hwa cynges mundbrice elles gewyrce, gebete þæt mid V pundum on Engla lage, arcebiscopes 7 æþelinges mundbrice mid þrim pundum, oðres biscpæs 7 ealdormannes mid II pundum.</ab>
      </div>
